<%# A member's face, wherever a member is named.

    Three states, in order: a copy we hold (Letterboxd uploads — see
    lib/avatars.rb), a hotlinked Gravatar, or their initial in a grey circle for
    an account with no picture at all.

    Decorative: the name is always right next to it, so the image carries no
    alt text of its own rather than repeating the name to a screen reader. %>
<% src = user.avatar_src %>
<span class="avatar" aria-hidden="true"><%
  %><% if src %><img src="<%= src %>" alt="" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24"><% else %><%= user.initial %><% end %><%
%></span>
